{
    "word": "potation",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "7881d4f8-cf9a-389e-b864-ee83ec0afc61",
                "word": "potation",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "bd6619f2-542a-49fe-a41c-dee23f57e5f5",
                        "entry_id": "7881d4f8-cf9a-389e-b864-ee83ec0afc61",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "potations"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8e0f75d1-29d2-30a5-b098-9b2d776b81a7",
                        "entry_id": "7881d4f8-cf9a-389e-b864-ee83ec0afc61",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The act of drinking."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "in-plural",
                            "often",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "66f559a6-1579-442e-8492-482f2de7bdd0",
                                "sense_id": "8e0f75d1-29d2-30a5-b098-9b2d776b81a7",
                                "text": "[…] perhaps his nocturnal potations, prevented him from recognizing accents which were tolerably familiar to him—[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f5f37855-5b6c-4708-8e07-f1ba0445afee",
                                "sense_id": "8e0f75d1-29d2-30a5-b098-9b2d776b81a7",
                                "text": "[…] a quiet evening at home, alone with a friend and a pipe or two, and a humble potation of British spirits, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b364c79-d45f-4552-afc3-810d24dbf0f6",
                                "sense_id": "8e0f75d1-29d2-30a5-b098-9b2d776b81a7",
                                "text": "Slim, blond, and good-looking in his youth, he became somewhat bloated in middle age, and his potations did not improve his appearance."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ecc50a64-93e2-355b-bd60-18cfde647aa4",
                        "entry_id": "7881d4f8-cf9a-389e-b864-ee83ec0afc61",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A drink, especially an alcoholic beverage."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b36f3a0-1a23-4b03-9ad9-3a1042eea404",
                                "sense_id": "ecc50a64-93e2-355b-bd60-18cfde647aa4",
                                "text": "For as this is the Liquor of modern Hiſtorians, nay, perhaps their Muſe, if we may believe the Opinion of Butler, who attributes Inſpiration to Ale, it ought likewiſe to be the Potation of their Readers; ſince every Book ought to be read with the ſame Spirit, and in the ſame Manner, as it is writ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c846bbeb-5327-447d-8054-09e40d40e270",
                                "sense_id": "ecc50a64-93e2-355b-bd60-18cfde647aa4",
                                "text": "“Do Veniam,” said his Superior; and the old man seized, with a trembling hand, a beverage to which he had been long unaccustomed, drained the cup with protracted delight, as if dwelling on the flavour and perfume, and set it down with a melancholy smile and shake of the head, as if bidding adieu in future to such delicious potations."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f67f462c-b289-4681-ac13-89d8f4a473ce",
                                "sense_id": "ecc50a64-93e2-355b-bd60-18cfde647aa4",
                                "text": "Peter accepted the condition and slept off his potations and was up and briskly about his work next morning, causing Rita to reflect that such lapses were to be expected as a periodical visitation on Peter's industry, and could be counted as the cause of his derelict and vagabond existence."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7af18bdd-b050-486c-bfc4-9d6eb5afe348",
                                "sense_id": "ecc50a64-93e2-355b-bd60-18cfde647aa4",
                                "text": "The other potation was a juice made from grapes, pears and banana, drunk with pleasure at that greatest of rarities: a restaurant featuring healthy grub that actually tastes good."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ec851493-b1a5-454c-be9a-e2716e327489",
                                "sense_id": "ecc50a64-93e2-355b-bd60-18cfde647aa4",
                                "text": "I sipped my potation in one section of the bar, only to be told that it was reserved for a corporate party."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7bacfb8e-aab1-42fa-98b8-847dae6cf82a",
                                "sense_id": "ecc50a64-93e2-355b-bd60-18cfde647aa4",
                                "text": "Since the complex was refurbished, tourism has increased ninefold, drawing people to its pools and potations while also creating an ancillary industry of high-end hotels and candle shops."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f3a2c795-09df-467c-9b19-43da295839b0",
                        "source_entry_id": "7881d4f8-cf9a-389e-b864-ee83ec0afc61",
                        "source_sense_description": "act of drinking",
                        "target_lang_word": "питьё",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "питьё",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ac0faf36-9f9e-3635-9b9c-e857e12a72ff",
                                        "entry_id": "7b3ca88f-e9cb-3264-9302-2292bcfaa7a6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ед. ч. действие по значению гл. пить; употребление внутрь, поглощение жидкости"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0aff5d73-5bea-4999-b5b2-da459e63d80a",
                                                "sense_id": "ac0faf36-9f9e-3635-9b9c-e857e12a72ff",
                                                "text": "Питьё вина."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "409cccd1-2434-4920-8f1a-98c80f1d1cc0",
                                                "sense_id": "ac0faf36-9f9e-3635-9b9c-e857e12a72ff",
                                                "text": "Веселие на Руси есть питие!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ba442fe-ab08-3939-94b3-b03e988cbc41",
                                        "entry_id": "7b3ca88f-e9cb-3264-9302-2292bcfaa7a6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "то же, что напиток; то, что пьют"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5437e99b-8767-49f8-ade8-040c9024181c",
                                                "sense_id": "3ba442fe-ab08-3939-94b3-b03e988cbc41",
                                                "text": "Вкусное питьё."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e87a92b3-b801-4e84-a43c-659c71b3b309",
                        "source_entry_id": "7881d4f8-cf9a-389e-b864-ee83ec0afc61",
                        "source_sense_description": "a drink, especially an alcoholic beverage",
                        "target_lang_word": "вы́пивка",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "вы́пивка",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "65f3fc51-cc8b-31f9-9004-e4333fbe97f8",
                                        "entry_id": "553fc39d-7794-309e-9d1a-2c5b78be291e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "разг., собир., неисч. алкогольные напитки"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d896c7d7-f1d2-41ab-b76a-9bd2edf7cb19",
                                                "sense_id": "65f3fc51-cc8b-31f9-9004-e4333fbe97f8",
                                                "text": "По самым скромным подсчётам, выпивка и закуска для каждого гостя обошлись в несколько сот долларов."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fb8feebb-5827-3d85-9d36-cfa7c3ff94f3",
                                        "entry_id": "553fc39d-7794-309e-9d1a-2c5b78be291e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "разг. собрание, встреча для совместного употребления алкоголя"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b7da43d-8344-4f1e-b299-666ced6208f9",
                                                "sense_id": "fb8feebb-5827-3d85-9d36-cfa7c3ff94f3",
                                                "text": "Он был старше других офицеров, картам и выпивкам предпочитал книги, за что к нему относились с изрядной долей иронии."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "986414c3-29bc-4799-a906-ef0c4604850f",
                                                "sense_id": "fb8feebb-5827-3d85-9d36-cfa7c3ff94f3",
                                                "text": "Приятели Самсона по выпивкам очень её хвалили: она долго жила в Египте и знала все искусства тамошней любви."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9d950708-f201-4abf-b988-55aecf482fec",
                        "source_entry_id": "7881d4f8-cf9a-389e-b864-ee83ec0afc61",
                        "source_sense_description": "a drink, especially an alcoholic beverage",
                        "target_lang_word": "напи́ток",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "напи́ток",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "530faa50-c2b4-3d63-ac28-10d163baaeb6",
                                        "entry_id": "2c38446b-b43f-3ead-8336-6e580c57f0ef",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "специально приготовленная жидкость для питья"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "30e34c07-a64c-47e7-ab8b-135a63bb7b19",
                                                "sense_id": "530faa50-c2b4-3d63-ac28-10d163baaeb6",
                                                "text": "Я потребовал самовар и чаю, зная по опыту, что благодетельный этот напиток настолько же способен прохлаждать во время жары, насколько он обогревает в зимний холод."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ee4b992-98d5-4c94-9a0d-31b96b0de2f0",
                                                "sense_id": "530faa50-c2b4-3d63-ac28-10d163baaeb6",
                                                "text": "Кроме того, он принёс бутылку с квасом, которую он для пробы взял в кухне. Напиток этот был уже известен французам и получил название."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
